eartbeat attached to the current durable task; do not create a detached cron task or a second Chief-of-Staff task;\n- use a short name such as `Chief of Staff check-in`;\n- put the approved sources and operational behavior in a self-contained prompt, while keeping cadence and task targeting in the automation fields;\n- tell the heartbeat to retrieve intelligently, prioritize consequential unanswered or changing items, research enough context to prepare useful drafts, never send them without approval, stay quiet when nothing material changed, and append the configured trajectory receipt;\n- persist the returned automation identifier in operational configuration;\n- keep the task durable after each run rather than treating the recurrence as a temporary loop with a completion rename.\n","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"without approval","finding_ids":["finding-02ef2b7bb27a4ecb995deec0e1858347"],"id":"sha256:e3ad443000683b5c4d28a6ec78b675d63a50121422c1ec935b55373a6f2d452b","intent":null,"line":50,"match_fingerprint":"7868080a35a6878aa292c53196ddb331f19d628c33953fb70850fdaf54c4191c","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-02ef2b7bb27a4ecb995deec0e1858347","line":50,"path":"references/recurring-checks.md","start_column":169}],"path":"references/recurring-checks.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":169,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]}],"findings_truncated":false,"freshness":"current","id":"plugin:community:ef4e41f28b7fd3b125a92dbaecf210fa/chief-of-staff","kind":"plugi